      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "baseline 33–42% → briefed 4–8% defect reproduction\ntwo runs, n=24 each · conditional: 2/12 on the tasks\nthe baseline failed at least once\nreceipts: ab-20260830-0003 · ab-20260901-0133\ntasks were authored to invite classes the store covers,\nso this measures a briefing when a lesson exists.",
